        },
        {
            "id": "955967f2-b8bc-4545-bbf7-0e621a136f2e",
            "index": 3,
            "characterId": "3d251560-306a-4584-8903-bebe74011bfc",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3124",
            "content": {
                "en": "What are you trying to fix?",
                "zh": "请问您这是在修理什么呢？",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1174.0,
            "positionY": 124.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "a3e1b533-373a-472c-b903-a1895c16e64a",
            "index": 4,
            "characterId": "175d32ab-deb4-4be5-8f1d-b4b4c2e0fa60",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3125",
            "content": {
                "en": "It wasn’t supposed to be a repair job. They wanted to use a speaker to loop a sound effect next to their stall, and I just came to set up the program for them.",
                "zh": "本来不是修理的。这些人想要用印象在摊位旁边循环播放一个音效，我本来只是过来帮他们设定好程序的。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1506.0,
            "positionY": 122.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "df9fdef7-338a-4cea-b528-280859ceee9a",
            "index": 5,
            "characterId": "175d32ab-deb4-4be5-8f1d-b4b4c2e0fa60",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3126",
            "content": {
                "en": "But it looks like the hardware’s acting up, and now it won’t play properly. I’m still racking my brain over what to do.",
                "zh": "结果硬件好像出问题了，现在一直没法正常播放，我还在苦恼怎么办呢。",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 1838.0,
            "positionY": 124.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
            "conditionalBranches": []
        },
        {
            "id": "c4ee8103-eaa5-4b5f-84eb-9bd45f98ed39",
            "index": 6,
            "characterId": "443ed651-99c1-456e-8295-e76ba2741aa7",
            "useContentId": true,
            "contentId": "ch1_3267",
            "content": {
                "en": "Mind if I take a look? Maybe I can help.",
                "zh": "可以让我看看吗？说不定能帮到你！",
                "ja": ""
            },
            "positionX": 2174.0,
            "positionY": 124.0,
            "choices": [],
            "eventCalls": [],
